        "rationale": "The term is URL-encoded with `urllib.parse.urlencode` for the query string, the full href is then escaped with `html.escape(quote=True)` for the attribute, and the visible text is escaped with `html.escape`, so neither `\"><script>x</script>` nor `a&b=c` can break out, and tests cover both cases."
